  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 608.01 Use of Money Payments.\n\n(a) The individual shall be responsible for the satisfaction of the individual’s creditors to the same extent as any other citizen.\n\n(b) The department shall not intervene in disputes involving the individual and a provider in matters relating to financial obligations.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8452, eff 10-22-05; ss by #10495, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13760, eff 9-28-23",
